Task: list the validation batches (normally three), in order.
- Batch numbers are handwritten and OCR often spells them differently in different places.
  Choose the most consistent reading as batch_number and list every other spelling you see in
  batch_number_variants (empty list if none).
- If batches are planned but no batch numbers are filled in, still return one entry per planned
  batch with batch_number null.
- Return an empty list if the document does not mention individual batches.

